sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as Processes Dashboard
    participant PBM as Process Builder Modal
    participant TS as Template Service
    participant API as Backend API
    participant IS as Integration Service
    participant DB as Database

    U->>PD: Access processes dashboard
    PD->>U: Display existing processes and actions
    
    Note over U, PD: User chooses template-based creation
    U->>PD: Click "Browse Templates"
    PD->>PBM: Open Process Builder Modal
    PBM->>U: Display "Process Templates" tab (active)
    
    Note over PBM: Load available templates
    PBM->>TS: GET /api/templates/categories
    TS->>PBM: Return template categories
    PBM->>U: Show template categories (Marketing, Sales, Support)
    
    U->>PBM: Select "Marketing" category
    PBM->>TS: GET /api/templates/marketing
    TS->>PBM: Return marketing templates
    PBM->>U: Display marketing template gallery
    
    Note over U, PBM: User selects template
    PBM->>U: Show template cards with previews
    U->>PBM: Click "Email Campaign Automation" template
    PBM->>TS: GET /api/templates/{id}/details
    TS->>PBM: Return template configuration
    PBM->>U: Show template details modal
    PBM->>U: Display template description and requirements
    U->>PBM: Click "Use This Template"
    
    Note over PBM: Template customization
    PBM->>PBM: Switch to "Process Details" tab
    PBM->>U: Pre-populate form with template data
    PBM->>U: Show editable fields with template defaults
    
    U->>PBM: Modify process name "Q1 Product Launch Campaign"
    U->>PBM: Update description with custom content
    U->>PBM: Keep department as "Marketing"
    U->>PBM: Change priority to "High"
    
    Note over PBM: Integration inheritance
    PBM->>IS: GET /api/integrations/template-requirements
    IS->>PBM: Return required integrations from template
    PBM->>U: Show pre-selected integrations
    PBM->>U: Display template tools (Mailchimp, Canva, Analytics)
    
    U->>PBM: Add additional integration "HubSpot"
    PBM->>IS: Check HubSpot connection status
    IS->>PBM: Connection available
    PBM->>U: Add HubSpot to selected tools
    
    Note over PBM: Template preview
    U->>PBM: Click "Process Preview" tab
    PBM->>TS: GET /api/templates/{id}/preview
    TS->>PBM: Return template preview data
    PBM->>U: Show customized process preview
    PBM->>U: Display AI worker perspective with template context
    
    Note over PBM: Template validation
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/validate-template
    API->>TS: Validate template compatibility
    TS->>API: Template validation successful
    API->>IS: Verify all required integrations
    IS->>API: All integrations available
    API->>PBM: Template ready for deployment
    
    Note over PBM: Template deployment
    U->>PBM: Click "Create from Template"
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/create-from-template
    API->>TS: Apply template configuration
    TS->>API: Template applied with customizations
    API->>DB: Save process with template metadata
    DB->>API: Process created with template reference
    API->>PBM: Process created successfully
    
    Note over PBM: Success feedback
    PBM->>U: Show "Process created from template" success message
    PBM->>PD: Close modal, refresh dashboard
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes
    API->>PD: Return updated process list
    PD->>U: Show new process with "Template" badge
    
    Note over PD: Template usage tracking
    PD->>TS: POST /api/templates/{id}/usage
    TS->>TS: Increment template usage counter
    PD->>U: Display updated process metrics
    PD->>U: Show template-based process in recent activity 